,"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055","text":"先是，二宮並闕，中外職司，多遣子弟給侍。全琮報遜，遜以為“子弟苟有才，不憂不用，不宜私出以要榮利。若其不佳，終為取禍。且聞二宮勢敵，必有彼此，此古人之厚忌也。”琮子寄，果阿附魯王，輕為交構。遜書與琮曰：「卿不師日磾，而宿留阿寄，終為足下門戶致禍矣。」琮既不納，更以致隙。及太子有不安之儀，遜上疏陳：「太子正統，宜有磐石之固，魯王藩臣，當使寵秩有差，彼此得所，上下獲安。謹叩頭流血以聞。」書三四上，及求詣都，欲口論適庶之分，以匡得失。既不聽許，而遜外生顧譚、顧承、姚信，工以親附太子，枉見流徙。太子太傅吾粲坐數與遜交書，下獄死。權累遣中使責讓遜，遜憤恚致卒，時年六十三。家無餘財。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"琮","kind":"person","person_id":"984_9e1_5e9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"琮","kind":"person","person_id":"984_9e1_5e9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"寄","kind":"person","person_id":"984_9e1_5e9_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"魯王","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:li